{"id":"rdb-1ed603","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e5b151c9-b04a-4852-aa30-a0ef1145fe81","text":"Fix applied in `c09664f`:\n\n- `engine/engine.go:530` — added `strings.ReplaceAll(value, `\\`, `\\\\`)` before the existing single-quote escaping\n- `engine/engine_test.go` — added `TestStringParameterBackslashRoundTrip` with 7 cases: bare backslash, escaped quote, double backslash, `\\n`, `\\t`, full JSON payload, and single-quote-with-backslash\n\nAll 14 test packages pass. No decisions outside the spec."},"created_at":"2026-09-14T06:24:38.296455Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.270 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
